<title>USA: First Midwest vice chairman resigns.</title>
<headline>First Midwest vice chairman resigns.</headline>
<dateline>STORM LAKE, Iowa 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firt Midwest Financial Inc said Monday that Steven Myers, board vice chairman and senior vice president, First Midwest Financial Inc and First Federal Savings Bank of the Midwest, resigned to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>James Haahr, chairman of the board, president and chief executive officer of First Midwest Financial, will assume duties previously performed by Myers.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
